WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.410
- Okay, so this is possible
one of my favorite questions

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.860
I've ever asked.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.330
I heard you drank sheep
poo whiskey in Tasmania,

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.096
and I need details.

00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:13.980
- (laughs) So Tasmania's a
beautiful, tiny little part

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.920
of Australia.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.140
It only has something like
300,000 people live there.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:21.150
But there's over something
like 60 wine distilleries,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:21.983
incredible.

00:00:21.983 --> 00:00:23.270
Whiskey distilleries, excuse me.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.930
- These are my kind of people.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.530
- Yeah, we met this amazing man

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:31.230
that was brewing this incredible whiskey.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.240
But everything was so resourceful,

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.760
the way they wasted nothing.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.710
And so, when I started working with him,

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.923
I was shoveling sheep (bleeps).

00:00:38.923 --> 00:00:40.270
And it was the sheep (bleeps)
(laughs)

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.140
that was literally smokin' the rye

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.400
that was starting the
fermentation for the whiskey.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.360
And it's actually called
sheep poo whiskey.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.360
And honestly, these production
was 150 tiny, little bottles.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.350
It was already selling
out before we finished it,

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.360
it was that sought after.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.660
- Wow, who knew that sheep poo

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.887
could be so lucrative?
(laughs)

